    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read these results",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Evidence boundary:** OS values marked \"documented\" come from the IaC estate snapshot; \"inferred_dns\" and \"inferred_nmap\" are candidates, not verified operating systems. DNS hints are a dated 18–25 Sep 2026 snapshot. **Ports are observed open ports from selected-port enrichment or the completed portion of a top-100 Nmap scan.** \"No open ports evidenced\" and scan timeouts do **not** mean that all ports are closed. Inventory includes currently observed and historically retained devices."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "All network devices — identity, OS and observed open ports",
      "description": "Includes canonical infrastructure, discovery inventory, router inventory and dated DNS hints. An absent open-port observation is not a closed port.",
